---
import AppLayout from '../../../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import OpenEvoQuestionIndex from '../../../../../components/research/OpenEvoQuestionIndex.astro';
import { W_ADVISOR_CALL_PREPARATION as prep } from '../../../../../data/wAdvisorCallPreparation';
import '../../../../../styles/openevo-research-blogs.css';
import '../../../../../styles/research-article.css';
import '../../../../../styles/advisor-ten-approved-reader.css';

// A direct-link preparation page. No unredacted source material or third-party
// discussion history is bundled with the public GitHub repository.
const questions = prep.questions.map(q => ({ id: q.id, title: q.question, headingNumber: q.number }));
---

<AppLayout
  title={prep.title}
  description="面向 W 老师的科研沟通准备：开场、研究问题、招生机会、十二道可能追问和五种答复。仅提供脱敏后的准备材料。"
  locale="zh"
>
  <article class="evo-blog evo-article evo-approved-reader wcall-report" data-w-advisor-report data-reader-page="research-blog" data-copy-review>
    <header class="evo-article__header">
      <h1>{prep.title}</h1>
      <p class="evo-article__lede" data-reader-purpose>{prep.purpose}</p>
      <p class="wcall-boundary"><strong>沟通边界：</strong>{prep.boundary}</p>
      <p class="evo-article__note">{prep.dateBoundary}</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="evo-article__toc" aria-label="电话准备目录">
      <details class="advisor-ten-toc">
        <summary>目录</summary>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#call-opening">开场与机会</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-schedule">通话节奏</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-quick">电话前速记</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-questions">十二道追问</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-reactions">五种回应</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-avoid">避免的说法</a></li>
          <li><a href="#call-after">通话结束后的判断</a></li>
        </ol>
      </details>
    </nav>

    <section id="call-opening" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-opening-heading">
      <h2 id="call-opening-heading">1 开场与机会</h2>
      <p>主动表达的内容最好控制在两分钟以内；如果 W 老师开始提问，就停下来听。</p>
      <h3>研究意愿</h3>
      <blockquote class="wcall-speech">
        {prep.opening.map(line => <p>{line}</p>)}
      </blockquote>
      <h3>名额与接收意愿</h3>
      <blockquote class="wcall-speech">
        {prep.opportunity.map(line => <p>{line}</p>)}
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section id="call-schedule" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-schedule-heading">
      <h2 id="call-schedule-heading">2 通话节奏</h2>
      <p>下面的时间只是准备框架，不要求通话严格按分钟执行。</p>
      <ol class="wcall-schedule">
        {prep.schedule.map(step => (
          <li>
            <span class="wcall-schedule__time">{step.time}</span>
            <div><strong>{step.goal}</strong><p>{step.action}</p></div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section id="call-quick" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-quick-heading">
      <h2 id="call-quick-heading">3 电话前速记</h2>
      <p>四句可直接调用的简短表达。原稿强调科研判断与事实，不提供努力程度或按时毕业的保证。</p>
      <dl class="wcall-quicklines">
        {prep.quickLines.map(line => (
          <div><dt>{line.label}</dt><dd>{line.text}</dd></div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="call-questions" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-questions-heading">
      <h2 id="call-questions-heading">4 十二道可能追问</h2>
      <p>这些问题用于预演，并非 W 老师已提出的十二句原话。每一项先列可能评估的科研维度，再保留建议回答和答复边界。</p>
      <OpenEvoQuestionIndex questions={questions} ariaLabel="快速定位十二道 W 老师可能追问" heading="按可能追问查找回答" />
      <div class="wcall-questions">
        {prep.questions.map(q => (
          <section class="wcall-question" id={'response-' + q.id} aria-labelledby={'heading-' + q.id}>
            <div class="advisor-approved-question-meta"><span class="advisor-approved-question-ref">{q.number}</span><span>可能追问</span></div>
            <h3 id={'heading-' + q.id}>{q.question}</h3>
            <p><strong>可能评估的维度（预演）：</strong>{q.concern}</p>
            <details class="wcall-answer" open={q.id === 'q02' || q.id === 'q03' || q.id === 'q05'}>
              <summary>建议回答</summary>
              <div class="wcall-answer__body">{q.answer.map(line => <p>{line}</p>)}</div>
            </details>
            <p class="wcall-question__note"><strong>回答边界：</strong>{q.note}</p>
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="call-reactions" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-reactions-heading">
      <h2 id="call-reactions-heading">5 W 老师的五种回应</h2>
      <p>同样一句话，能确认的事实可能比听起来少。这里把“实际表态”“可确认的含义”和“下一句回答”分开。</p>
      <ol class="wcall-reactions">
        {prep.reactions.map(s => (
          <li>
            <h3>{s.says}</h3>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>能够确认</dt><dd>{s.confirms}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>建议回应</dt><dd>{s.reply}</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <p class="evo-article__note">如果得到明确拒绝，应尊重这一决定。对于科研顾虑，可以进一步询问最关键的不足，但无需立即反驳。</p>
    </section>

    <section id="call-avoid" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-avoid-heading">
      <h2 id="call-avoid-heading">6 避免的说法</h2>
      <dl class="wcall-avoid">
        {prep.avoid.map(item => (
          <div><dt>{item.phrase}</dt><dd>{item.reason}</dd></div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="call-after" class="evo-article__section" aria-labelledby="call-after-heading">
      <h2 id="call-after-heading">7 通话结束后的判断</h2>
      <ol class="wcall-after">
        {prep.afterCall.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ol>
      <p>如果 W 老师允许继续了解机会，不能转述成已同意接收；如果他保留判断，就如实记录仍需验证的条件。</p>
      <p class="evo-article__note">本页只保存向 W 老师沟通所需的脱敏准备内容，不包含其他人的姓名、私人通话记录或第三方关系分析。科研事实和最新招生情况仍应分别以可核查的原始来源为准。</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</AppLayout>

<style>
  .wcall-report .wcall-boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .wcall-report .wcall-speech {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-5);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-surface-muted);
  }
  .wcall-report .wcall-speech p { margin: .45em 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule,
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule li:last-child { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--paper-line); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule__time { font-size: var(--type-meta); color: var(--paper-muted); white-space: nowrap; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule strong { font-weight: var(--type-weight-heading); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-schedule p { margin: 3px 0 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-quicklines { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 var(--space-5); margin: var(--space-4) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-quicklines > div { border-block-start: 1px solid var(--paper-line); padding: var(--space-3) 0; min-width: 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-quicklines dt { color: var(--paper-muted); font-size: var(--type-meta); margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-quicklines dd { margin: 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-question {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    padding: var(--space-5) 0;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--site-header-height) + var(--space-5));
  }
  .wcall-report .wcall-question h3 { margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-3); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-question p { margin: var(--space-2) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-answer { border-block: 1px solid var(--paper-line); margin: var(--space-3) 0; padding: var(--space-2) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-answer summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: var(--type-weight-label); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-answer__body { margin: var(--space-3) 0; padding-inline-start: var(--space-4); border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--color-accent); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-question__note { color: var(--paper-muted); font-size: var(--type-meta); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions > li { border-block-start: 1px solid var(--paper-line); padding: var(--space-4) 0; margin: 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions > li:last-child { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--paper-line); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions h3 { font-size: var(--type-article-subsection); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions dl { margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions dt { font-size: var(--type-meta); color: var(--paper-muted); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-reactions dd { margin: var(--space-1) 0 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-avoid { margin: var(--space-3) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-avoid > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-3); border-block-start: 1px solid var(--paper-line); padding: var(--space-3) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-avoid > div:last-child { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--paper-line); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-avoid dt { font-weight: var(--type-weight-medium); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-avoid dd { margin: 0; color: var(--paper-muted); }
  .wcall-report .wcall-after { margin: var(--space-3) 0; }
  .wcall-report .wcall-after li { margin: var(--space-2) 0; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .wcall-report .wcall-quicklines { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .wcall-report .wcall-reactions dl,
    .wcall-report .wcall-avoid > div { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-2); }
    .wcall-report .wcall-schedule li { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-1); }
  }
  @media print {
    .wcall-report .wcall-answer { break-inside: avoid; }
    .wcall-report .wcall-answer:not([open]) .wcall-answer__body { display: block; }
  }
</style>
